{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  task 0003 (Task 6) — "See Flora Bella In Action" (video showcase)
  ============================================================================
  Fully custom section — no native Horizon section does a large featured-video
  player driven by a clickable thumbnail row. Built from scratch per DXB's
  explicit request for this section.

  NOTE: this comment deliberately never spells out the Liquid tag delimiters
  for the schema, stylesheet, or javascript blocks below (plain words are
  used instead) — see the 2026-09-06 lesson in this project's
  self_improve/LESSONS.md: writing the literal opening-tag text for any of
  those inside a comment has broken a real section file in this same task
  before.

  WHAT THIS FILE NEEDS ALONGSIDE IT:
    - blocks/bfbella-video.liquid   (0003_task6_bfbella-video.liquid)
  Each video block renders itself as a thumbnail button (2026-09-07: rebuilt from a
  "pure data block" — see that file's own comment for why; a block referenced from an
  external blocks/*.liquid file cannot be read as data from the parent section, confirmed
  live via Task 4's identical bug in this same task series).

  CONTENT: zero real copy is hardcoded anywhere in this file. Every heading,
  label, and video is a native Shopify setting or block field, blank until
  DXB fills it in via Admin. See 0003_task6_howto.md for the exact
  production text/video IDs and where each piece goes.

  COLOR: no hardcoded hex anywhere. The one accent color used throughout
  (active-thumbnail border, play-icon badge) resolves through
  `section.settings.accent_color` when set, falling back to the theme's own
  `color_palette.color3` — same fallback-chain pattern as Task 5.

  FEATURED PLAYER IS JS-POPULATED, NOT SERVER-RENDERED (2026-09-07 change): the section can no
  longer read the first video block's `youtube_id`/`title` here to server-render the featured
  iframe — a parent section cannot read a theme block's settings at all (same constraint that
  broke Task 4). So the featured player always starts as an empty placeholder, and this
  section's own JS immediately populates it from the first rendered thumbnail's data attributes
  on load (the same code path the click-to-swap handler already used). This requires JS to show
  a featured video at all; each thumbnail block still renders a real `<img>` even without JS, so
  the thumbnail row itself degrades gracefully — only the large featured player does not.

  TWO CONTENT MODES (see "Content source" setting):
    - Manual: the section renders whatever Video blocks are configured below,
      first block featured, rest as the thumbnail row. Zero JS network calls
      needed for the thumbnail row; the featured player still needs JS (see above).
      This is what "hard-code the youtube video IDs in place" (DXB's own
      phrasing for this task) means in practice — the IDs live in native
      block settings, not literally hardcoded in this file.
    - Playlist: on top of whatever Video blocks are configured (which stay as
      a same-page fallback), client-side JS fetches the given YouTube
      playlist via the YouTube Data API v3, sorts by publish date, and
      replaces the featured video + thumbnail row with the live playlist —
      newest video first. Requires DXB to provide a YouTube Data API key and
      a playlist ID; see 0003_task6_howto.md for exactly how to get both.
      Liquid cannot make outbound HTTP calls at render time, so this half of
      the feature is unavoidably client-side JS, not server-rendered.

  DEPLOY: save as sections/bfbella-video-showcase.liquid in the live theme.
  DXB applies this — Claude never commits or touches the live repo.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign accent = section.settings.accent_color | default: settings.color_palette.color3

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id, skip_contrast: true
  endif
%}

<bfbella-video-showcase
  id="VideoShowcase-{{ section.id }}"
  class="bfbella-video-showcase{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
  style="
    --bfbella-accent: {{ accent }};
    {% if section.settings.padding_top != blank %}--bfbella-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.padding_bottom != blank %}--bfbella-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;{% endif %}
  "
  {% if section.settings.content_source == 'playlist' and section.settings.playlist_id != blank and section.settings.youtube_api_key != blank %}
    data-playlist-id="{{ section.settings.playlist_id }}"
    data-api-key="{{ section.settings.youtube_api_key }}"
    data-max-videos="{{ section.settings.max_videos }}"
  {% endif %}
>
  <div class="bfbella-video-showcase__inner page-width">

    <div class="bfbella-video-showcase__grid">

      {%- comment -%}
        Featured player (left) — always starts empty. A theme block can't be read as data from
        here (see comment at top of file), so this section can no longer pull the first video's
        youtube_id/title to server-render the iframe; this section's own JS populates it from
        the first rendered thumbnail's data attributes immediately on load.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="bfbella-video-showcase__featured">
        <div class="bfbella-video-showcase__featured-frame">
          <div data-bfbella-featured-empty class="bfbella-video-showcase__featured-empty">
            {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'bfbella-video-showcase__placeholder-svg' }}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bfbella-video-showcase__featured-caption">
          <span data-bfbella-featured-title class="bfbella-video-showcase__featured-title"></span>
          <span data-bfbella-featured-platform class="bfbella-video-showcase__featured-platform"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Heading + subheading + thumbnail grid (right) {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="bfbella-video-showcase__content">
        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="bfbella-video-showcase__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
          <p class="bfbella-video-showcase__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
          <div data-bfbella-thumb-grid class="bfbella-video-showcase__thumbs">
            {% content_for 'blocks' %}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</bfbella-video-showcase>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bfbella-video-showcase {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    padding-block-start: var(--bfbella-pad-top, 6rem);
    padding-block-end: var(--bfbella-pad-bottom, 6rem);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__inner {
    max-width: 80rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;

    @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 22rem) 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  /* Featured player */
  .bfbella-video-showcase__featured {
    margin-inline: auto;
    max-width: 22rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__featured-frame {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
    background-color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb));
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.2);
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__featured-frame iframe {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__featured-empty {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__placeholder-svg {
    width: 40%;
    height: 40%;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__featured-caption {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    margin-block-start: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__featured-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__featured-platform {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* Heading / subheading */
  .bfbella-video-showcase__heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__subheading {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-block-end: 2rem;
  }

  /* Thumbnail grid */
  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumbs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;

    @media screen and (min-width: 480px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 0;
    border: 2px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.15);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb.is-active {
    border-color: var(--bfbella-accent);
    transform: scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--bfbella-accent) 25%, transparent);
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-play {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -75%);
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bfbella-accent) 85%, transparent);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-play::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 55%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    border-style: solid;
    border-width: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 0.65rem;
    border-color: transparent transparent transparent #fff;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb:hover .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-play,
  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb.is-active .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-play {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-caption {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-title {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-platform {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .bfbella-video-showcase__thumb {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
  class BfbellaVideoShowcase extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback() {
      this.featuredFrame = this.querySelector('[data-bfbella-featured-frame]');
      this.featuredEmpty = this.querySelector('[data-bfbella-featured-empty]');
      this.featuredTitle = this.querySelector('[data-bfbella-featured-title]');
      this.featuredPlatform = this.querySelector('[data-bfbella-featured-platform]');
      this.thumbGrid = this.querySelector('[data-bfbella-thumb-grid]');
      this.thumbs = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-bfbella-thumb]'));

      this.thumbs.forEach((thumb) => {
        thumb.addEventListener('click', () => this.selectVideo(thumb));
      });

      // Featured player is never server-rendered (see file header comment) — populate it from
      // the first thumbnail immediately so manual mode works with zero network calls. Playlist
      // mode (below) replaces this once its fetch resolves.
      if (this.thumbs.length > 0) {
        this.selectVideo(this.thumbs[0]);
      }

      const playlistId = this.dataset.playlistId;
      const apiKey = this.dataset.apiKey;
      if (playlistId && apiKey) {
        const maxVideos = parseInt(this.dataset.maxVideos, 10) || 6;
        this.loadPlaylist(playlistId, apiKey, maxVideos);
      }
    }

    selectVideo(thumb) {
      const id = thumb.dataset.youtubeId;
      if (!id) return;

      if (this.featuredFrame) {
        this.featuredFrame.src = 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/' + id;
      } else if (this.featuredEmpty) {
        const frame = document.createElement('iframe');
        frame.setAttribute('data-bfbella-featured-frame', '');
        frame.src = 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/' + id;
        frame.allow = 'accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture';
        frame.allowFullscreen = true;
        this.featuredEmpty.replaceWith(frame);
        this.featuredFrame = frame;
        this.featuredEmpty = null;
      }

      if (this.featuredTitle) this.featuredTitle.textContent = thumb.dataset.title || '';
      if (this.featuredPlatform) this.featuredPlatform.textContent = thumb.dataset.platform || 'YouTube';

      this.thumbs.forEach((t) => t.classList.toggle('is-active', t === thumb));
    }

    async loadPlaylist(playlistId, apiKey, maxVideos) {
      try {
        const url = 'https://www.googleapis.com/youtube/v3/playlistItems'
          + '?part=snippet&playlistId=' + encodeURIComponent(playlistId)
          + '&maxResults=' + Math.min(maxVideos, 50)
          + '&key=' + encodeURIComponent(apiKey);

        const response = await fetch(url);
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error('YouTube API request failed: ' + response.status);

        const data = await response.json();
        const items = (data.items || [])
          .filter((item) => item.snippet && item.snippet.resourceId && item.snippet.resourceId.videoId)
          .sort((a, b) => new Date(b.snippet.publishedAt) - new Date(a.snippet.publishedAt));

        if (items.length === 0) return;

        this.renderPlaylist(items);
      } catch (error) {
        // Playlist fetch failed (bad key, quota, network) — the server-rendered
        // manual blocks (if any) stay exactly as they were. No broken/empty state.
        console.error('BFBella video showcase: could not load YouTube playlist.', error);
      }
    }

    renderPlaylist(items) {
      if (!this.thumbGrid) return;

      this.thumbGrid.innerHTML = '';
      const newThumbs = [];

      items.forEach((item) => {
        const videoId = item.snippet.resourceId.videoId;
        const title = item.snippet.title || '';
        const thumbnails = item.snippet.thumbnails || {};
        const thumbUrl = (thumbnails.medium || thumbnails.default || {}).url
          || ('https://img.youtube.com/vi/' + videoId + '/hqdefault.jpg');

        const button = document.createElement('button');
        button.type = 'button';
        button.className = 'bfbella-video-showcase__thumb';
        button.setAttribute('data-bfbella-thumb', '');
        button.dataset.youtubeId = videoId;
        button.dataset.title = title;
        button.dataset.platform = 'YouTube';

        const img = document.createElement('img');
        img.src = thumbUrl;
        img.alt = title;
        img.loading = 'lazy';
        img.className = 'bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-img';

        const play = document.createElement('span');
        play.className = 'bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-play';
        play.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');

        const caption = document.createElement('span');
        caption.className = 'bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-caption';
        caption.innerHTML = '<span class="bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-title"></span>'
          + '<span class="bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-platform">YouTube</span>';
        caption.querySelector('.bfbella-video-showcase__thumb-title').textContent = title;

        button.append(img, play, caption);
        button.addEventListener('click', () => this.selectVideo(button));

        this.thumbGrid.appendChild(button);
        newThumbs.push(button);
      });

      this.thumbs = newThumbs;
      this.selectVideo(newThumbs[0]);
    }
  }

  customElements.define('bfbella-video-showcase', BfbellaVideoShowcase);
{% endjavascript %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "BFBella — Video Showcase",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "bfbella-video"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content source"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_source",
      "label": "Content source",
      "options": [
        { "value": "manual", "label": "Manual — Video blocks only" },
        { "value": "playlist", "label": "YouTube playlist (auto, newest first)" }
      ],
      "default": "manual",
      "info": "Playlist mode still uses the Video blocks below as a fallback if the playlist fetch ever fails."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "playlist_id",
      "label": "YouTube playlist ID",
      "info": "The part after \"list=\" in the playlist's URL. Only used when Content source is set to Playlist."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "youtube_api_key",
      "label": "YouTube Data API key",
      "info": "A domain-restricted API key from Google Cloud Console — see the howto doc for setup steps. Only used when Content source is set to Playlist. This key is visible in the page's HTML; restrict it to this domain and to the YouTube Data API only."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_videos",
      "label": "Max videos from playlist",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "Accent color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Used for the active-thumbnail border and play-icon badge. Leave blank to use the theme's existing color3 swatch."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 96
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 96
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "BFBella — Video Showcase",
      "category": "Custom",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "bfbella-video" },
        { "type": "bfbella-video" },
        { "type": "bfbella-video" },
        { "type": "bfbella-video" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
